// Probe: first-party metaprogramming (macro, compile-time code generation, or
// runtime reflection over program structure).  Quidra 0.2.0 has no macro
// construct and no reflection namespace; the reserved standard namespaces are
// math cli file environment test time random process map set json http tensor
// stats linear signal image neural.
class Rec
    int a
    int b

print("X12 meta {reflect.fields(Rec)}")
